:name: Pixhawk 6X FMU boot
:description: Boots the OE-built px4-firmware ELF (px4_fmu-v6x_default)
    against Renode's STM32H743 CPU model, per specs/003-renode-boot.md.

using sysbus
$name?="pixhawk6x"
mach create $name

machine LoadPlatformDescription @recipes-renode/pixhawk6x/pixhawk6x.repl

showAnalyzer usart3

// $bin is expected to be set by the caller (robot test or `-e`
// invocation) to the real DEPLOY_DIR_IMAGE path for
// px4-firmware-<PV>-pixhawk-6x.elf -- no default is guessed here,
// since a stale/wrong default would be worse than an explicit error.
macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""

runMacro $reset
